6 ÷ 162 = 1/27. Yes, because 6 × 1/162 = 1/27.

Then, ∛(1/27). Since 27 is 3^3, then ∛(1/27) = ∛(1)/∛27 = 1/3. Yes, correct.

Therefore, the expression inside the brackets is 1/3.

Then, P = (1/3)^{-1} = 3. Yes, correct.

