Similarly, ∛(1/162) = (1/162)^{1/3}

Therefore, the product is 6^{1/3} × (1/162)^{1/3}

Which is equal to [6 × (1/162)]^{1/3}

Which is equal to [6 × (1/162)]^{1/3}

Which is equal to [ (6 × 1/162) ]^{1/3}

Compute 6 × 1/162:

As before, 6/162 = 1/27
